imer along  with behind the scenes shots of Nolan as  well as two covers the movie is also  said to be the very first to be shot in  entirely in IMAX black and white which  is certainly consistent with the wartime  and post-war atmosphere the cast is also  very impressive with Downey Jr and  Murphy being joined by Florence Pugh  Gary Oldman and Ramy Malek in various  roles we are looking forward to the  Nolan biopic about the father of the  atomic bomb which is scheduled for  release on July 21st 2023.  actor Jackie Chan took to the stage at  the Red Sea film festival few expected  him to announce a sequel to an iconic  movie series completely unexpectedly  chance spoke of an upcoming Rush Hour 4  that was now officially in the works  that same evening he said he had  arranged a meeting with the director to  reveal his plans red Ratner has directed  all three Rush Hour movies to date the  last installment came out 15 years ago  and ratner's last time directing was in  2014 for Hercules in 2017 when the  director was also confronted with  accusations of sexual harassment Warner  Brothers ended all contracts with the 53  year old and his company Rat Pack thus  the announcement of a sequel came as a  great surprise and an actual engagement  of Ratner as a director is considered  very unlikely in terms of plot the  popular comedy movie series revolves  around inspector Lee who was tasked by  the Chinese Consul to conduct  investigations in Los Angeles under the  supervision of local police officer  James Carter later the two become  friends and saw various cases together  due to its funny and distinctive style  the movie series is still very famous  today which is mainly due to the  chemistry of the two main actors Jackie  Chan and Chris Tucker a planned release  date is not known yet which is not  really strange considering the very  early stage of production stay tuned for  further news  alright that's it for this week we  suggest you check out the latest  Spider-Man 